flowchart TD
  REQ[HTTP request] --> CID[CorrelationIdFilter - MDC, outermost]
  CID --> CORS[CorsFilter]
  CORS --> JWT[JwtAuthFilter - verify HS256, check revocation, bind TenantContext]
  JWT --> UPA[UsernamePasswordAuthenticationFilter - disabled here]
  UPA --> AUTHZ[AuthorizationFilter - authorizeHttpRequests rules]
  AUTHZ -->|permitted| DS[DispatcherServlet]
  AUTHZ -->|no authentication| E401[401 UNAUTHENTICATED via entry point]
  AUTHZ -->|authenticated but not allowed| E403[403 FORBIDDEN via access denied handler]
  DS --> MS[PreAuthorize method security with role hierarchy]
  MS --> CTRL[Controller then Service]
  CTRL --> ADV[RestControllerAdvice maps exceptions to the error schema]
  JWT -. finally clear TenantContext and SecurityContext .-> REQ
